</code></pre> <p>The route validates with the model first, then runs the rules on <code>result.original_data</code>, the submission decoded into the same nested shape as the model. If either fails, both sets of errors are passed to <code>render_with_errors(errors=...)</code>, so the user sees every problem at once.</p> <p>Rules skip empty values, so an optional field is only checked when it's filled in; add <code>RequiredRule()</code> when a value must be present.</p>
